---
title: Home
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    {% include "partials/head.njk" %}
</head>
<body class="page-home">

    {% include "partials/header.njk" %}

    <main id="main">

        <div id="case-studies" class="case-studies">
        <div class="layout">

            <h2 class="case-studies__heading">Case Studies</h2>
            <p class="case-studies__intro">Selected in-house work at AdRoll, 2020&ndash;2026.</p>

            <article class="case-study-card">

                <h3 class="case-study-card__title">GEO / AEO Authority Pilot</h3>
                <p class="case-study-card__role">Technical SEO, Content Strategy, Web Development</p>

                <p>Applied structured entity data (Schema.org) alongside hub-and-spoke-style topic cluster, validated against a control group with a Difference-in-Differences framework.</p>
                <p>Result: +11.75% organic search lift from internal linking, +24.1% with verified SME authorship added; average search position improved from 24.27 to 18.43.</p>

                <ul class="case-study-card__tags">
                    <li class="case-study-card__tag">Answer engine optimization</li>
                    <li class="case-study-card__tag">Structured data</li>
                    <li class="case-study-card__tag">Entity authorship</li>
                    <li class="case-study-card__tag">Technical SEO</li>
                </ul>

                <a class="case-study-card__link button" href="/case-studies/geo-aeo-authority-pilot/">Read Case Study</a>

            </article>

            <article class="case-study-card">

                <h3 class="case-study-card__title">AdRoll 3.0: Website Design &amp; Development</h3>
                <p class="case-study-card__role">Web Design &amp; Development</p>

                <p>Site-wide rebrand and brand consolidation &mdash; folding two brands back into one identity and one site on a compressed timeline, without losing SEO equity or confusing existing customers.</p>
                <p>Sixty days post-launch: zero support tickets related to brand confusion, +87% first-time visitors to core pages, +42% homepage traffic.</p>

                <ul class="case-study-card__tags">
                    <li class="case-study-card__tag">Rebrand</li>
                    <li class="case-study-card__tag">Design systems</li>
                    <li class="case-study-card__tag">Front-end development</li>
                    <li class="case-study-card__tag">Statamic</li>
                </ul>

                <a class="case-study-card__link button" href="/case-studies/site-rebrand/">Read Case Study</a>

            </article>

        </div>
        </div>

        <div id="projects" class="projects">
        <div class="layout">

            <h2 class="projects__heading">Project Archive</h2>
            <p class="projects__intro">Selected freelance and agency work, 2004–2020.</p>

            <!-- Three new projects -->
            {%- for project in collections.projectListing -%}
            <article class="project">

                <figure class="project__thumbnail">
                    {% image project.data.thumbnail, project.data.thumbnailAlt, "(max-width: 648px) 76vw, 45vw", "project__mask", "project__image" %}
                </figure>

                <div class="project__content">

                    <h3 class="project__title">{{ project.data.title }}</h3>
                    <p class="project__role">{{ project.data.role }}</p>
                    <p class="project__info">{{ project.data.intro }}</p>
                    <a class="project__link button" href="{{ project.url }}">Review Project</a>

                </div>

            </article>
            {%- endfor -%}

        </div>
        </div>

    </main>

    {% include "partials/footer.njk" %}

</body>
</html>
